k2YTBlOTYyNjg3ZTYxZjExYzIyNGI5ZjRkYmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Adam Perry @ OpenAI","email":"anp@openai.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:55:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:55:36Z"},"message":"docs: document remote executor integration testing (#29790)\n\n## Why\n\nAgents need a clear default for writing remote-compatible integration\ntests and reproducible commands for each supported runner.\n\n## What\n\nExpand the `remote-tests` skill with fixture guidance, skip selection,\nand Docker and Wine commands. Add always-visible `AGENTS.md` guidance\nthat points new core and app-server tests toward automatic environment\nfixtures.\n\nStacked on #29789.","tree":{"sha":"c5c977cb662338a58e2f871352e0e0873b9e55bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/c5c977cb662338a58e2f871352e0e0873b9e55bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/31e428a1ef3396a0e962687e61f11c224b9f4dbc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO3FYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH+UQAEAGQiizWwMplOMdIbNn1aEb\nnTrLoYg7+cy346YQfmSQLL5uVY4rKjdOUXJ9nkDxhMS0EKUoU4YxD26V6slT8Gwk\niRUh+gWUvpUt7XFQw/TAFwtKq9x6+3vhrz2yhtdzWhOxiWvMAibV/I6SKonMMnNB\nL+n6fI2O+0UHysk8MJrhwFMHEEQ47w9X1SUyVBhjLzKzCVeXEGKNE4blSil5V5Lq\nosv2E9i9/ZIJRYSL4HKnznKAl1HyJw+WhX+Z5fW7k8+LzWbA77X3LDjXjd0BWSXm\ns7iQuwPK/JxSghYNvCKvIb6rWk9JBNtd7nSkQFiASdW0Kx0FBJznsTJlrMvQ9u4V\nFd7gF4JmPZVAza3VewHcXB8/orEdYeajCKbpOll1mGFj3Ythqy3TXYNdqXpE12UP\nX7AsccvfdrqKz70Asa88L3dk+H7b1vTrxZmQfyTVypJVOi8c7TDen8z8g3OKAEbU\nZX5YlKCHYY4TtLaWq08HVpKf/UMtOKbuO4oyMgawmySTGnX8vS7WwjxP08LVJG5b\n2o5NahpdyoblMcnR3nRbNMuOGeY/TefTDeJqQIJYojKn0JBzTCSKnfg/kR8srQR/\ngR219eZt+RoISte42a2+maSp0qMrZR/fh+JEZCx8yQsDMOpEXbJQOTq6HAuqZgZK\nwizih2DhZP1Ashuj3lm6\n=7OkL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c5c977cb662338a58e2f871352e0e0873b9e55bf\nparent c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e\nauthor Adam Perry @ OpenAI <anp@openai.com> 1782280536 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782280536 +0000\n\ndocs: document remote executor integration testing (#29790)\n\n## Why\n\nAgents need a clear default for writing remote-compatible integration\ntests and reproducible commands for each supported runner.\n\n## What\n\nExpand the `remote-tests` skill with fixture guidance, skip selection,\nand Docker and Wine commands. Add always-visible `AGENTS.md` guidance\nthat points new core and app-server tests toward automatic environment\nfixtures.\n\nStacked on #29789.","verified_at":"2026-06-24T05:55:37Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/31e428a1ef3396a0e962687e61f11c224b9f4dbc","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/31e428a1ef3396a0e962687e61f11c224b9f4dbc","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/31e428a1ef3396a0e962687e61f11c224b9f4dbc/comments","author":{"login":"anp-oai","id":286154589,"node_id":"U_kgDOEQ5fXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286154589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/anp-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e"}]},{"sha":"c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGMyYjNlM2I0ZjVmMDAwMjk3OTI4NTQzMTExMjI0NWNkZTQwNGM2NGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Adam Perry @ OpenAI","email":"anp@openai.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:48:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:48:06Z"},"message":"test: use automatic environments in app-server integration tests (#29789)\n\n## Why\n\nTopology-neutral app-server integration tests should exercise automatic\nenvironment selection so the same setup covers local and remote\nexecutors.\n\n## What\n\nMigrate eligible tests to `TestAppServer::new_with_auto_env()` and\n`send_thread_start_request_with_auto_env()`. Leave explicit-topology\ntests unchanged, and skip the request-permissions case on Windows with a\nTODO for cross-platform tool routing.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `just test -p codex-app-server`\n- `bazel test //codex-rs/app-server:app-server-all-wine-exec-test\n--test_output=errors`\n\nStacked on #29788.","tree":{"sha":"7f745ef04d8aed2d264ce7fe8ec8d0575251fa2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/7f745ef04d8aed2d264ce7fe8ec8d0575251fa2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO2+WCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAO08QADbrxVYwpAlCF1QM/8nP7NA1\nAPVHJNHEFX5AJx/f1yDLaV3DNzeygqGd4t79mAs1ZQ19faOacZlLIpF4kspNMkNP\nyKSBitVdj2CPano/koyqyUyJF8dH29G0JfA4wYxUQuVIbCL305iE1zecSNNRYuXD\n7hNwtYagZlgSNN3HQLqnvpoqGdp8apcfZKdxFL1AvIUO8ZrAz/HltfDo5cjJ/FoD\n3t+cZ16NLTQJ8768G59LUqQymXxWHznk21VXp71mMcvLXi1bOZ0rkN+9Z79WWLAv\no7FLv7VtEYR+mF+8B4v3b0bTbTT99b20MLCc/FOKhTu+KLE7O6/ZxtrbEWkwv4M9\nUnmYh42Rto1GcSTKofOVAl8HFrJqEWZBzW8sAFoyowwG03LiXZLYqs5TeP1jtbkT\nZYmPVqFJakc1+K9KynAaAuaRHyOf1CMyW9wyqYUU2YtHNksMAdQwsiiyEL5e6afJ\nesMqu/rJvx0Qci18jb3jWqvaQypkv9pKrfsYs1KrXddi2X2awoFzzxCoDf/Htxxk\nHTZbzfVcbJhKlpaJ9WK8tXBXLcP7tmPWS67lp3KdcTHHoA5D+8nEtBYH+5s8F2Gr\nEce++car+FqwyaIVVM2uauE1qMtX5bhUEHoLCoiXpLlHsd+fb7hCXeL5WyE5XMWO\nbQyi0ly853sV+QrvJ+LV\n=9qKJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7f745ef04d8aed2d264ce7fe8ec8d0575251fa2c\nparent b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108\nauthor Adam Perry @ OpenAI <anp@openai.com> 1782280086 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782280086 -0700\n\ntest: use automatic environments in app-server integration tests (#29789)\n\n## Why\n\nTopology-neutral app-server integration tests should exercise automatic\nenvironment selection so the same setup covers local and remote\nexecutors.\n\n## What\n\nMigrate eligible tests to `TestAppServer::new_with_auto_env()` and\n`send_thread_start_request_with_auto_env()`. Leave explicit-topology\ntests unchanged, and skip the request-permissions case on Windows with a\nTODO for cross-platform tool routing.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `just test -p codex-app-server`\n- `bazel test //codex-rs/app-server:app-server-all-wine-exec-test\n--test_output=errors`\n\nStacked on #29788.","verified_at":"2026-06-24T05:48:06Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/c2b3e3b4f5f0002979285431112245cde404c64e/comments","author":{"login":"anp-oai","id":286154589,"node_id":"U_kgDOEQ5fXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286154589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/anp-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108"}]},{"sha":"b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGIxN2YzMGViMmE2NzBhZDQ5YzVjY2NmZDdlMjk1NTNhYzYyY2YxMDg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Adam Perry @ OpenAI","email":"anp@openai.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:23:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:23:29Z"},"message":"test: run app-server integration tests under Wine (#29788)\n\n## Why\n\nMade a mistake when carving #29746 out of my local changes and the test\nwas missing from the build graph. Oops!\n\n## What\n\nEnable the app-server Wine exec test target. Remove the `manual` tag\nfrom generated Wine-exec test variants so wildcard Bazel test\ninvocations select them. Refactor the smoke test to ensure it passes\nwith current Windows support.","tree":{"sha":"b6cb8727a9c477bf347ae40757a50907d744dbd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/b6cb8727a9c477bf347ae40757a50907d744dbd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO2nRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADN4QAFc62a3XVEn+o+BK7qYG3asM\n3q1z4GAoDa5gR5217zlVj/h8HjKKHvFf+2IxUeADcxg4ZZ+NbDddQmKTTu6VgsET\naS8jom8WLXLkZOlLIWf+4a3cLPpg3FZLNOpLVSIHWuMVfZCJ81uyPdhnymjexRSJ\nLE0efosZRBEAFXLjCfBcG89zTcgkSdYSsxjsCJWkprXuLCr/As/YaJcEpptCUr5w\nn6kmz1t8vKTKqge+l52wct+08IAtGC9ocQnuuVvcD0+ktFK3841EyHIiOLhxe2il\nvuvxo5L3IVxCdvD4PTBbSIcZ3EiT2jQkO3Wg1lMoD8xpVD/g8kT49a7U0ZLQbCJb\nRCAWqs2a9PXE++JKcxBwVf4Wcb4iJQ5ijBgoCgPuOjSto0wpQA8WJb2yJAV5AiCJ\n/SEB+4demn3ccocauwqEXQKd5sj0YSeog9wOFMTExXGMp2vh11/O4NhjTdV+paDB\ny+BFHOxK0mLG2Fsgi78WXwb9XDGdAgKmUfplS31PWU+wcWcwJUP4CPNX4XxRs/el\nSWPkjGBs5t9ZgN40GoAbeB2VzwPyZqFGH7oJz7vnMKvndBI6nPzECulOdrmA8JOu\nPRkmfZTIDqBm4Ybjl8ABrzMK8hv/OxFZOxt9G+/p4eH+tXBbptz4VLzABS7WIsuP\n5ylZMd094LrigrJj3s5m\n=ZesF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b6cb8727a9c477bf347ae40757a50907d744dbd8\nparent e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8\nauthor Adam Perry @ OpenAI <anp@openai.com> 1782278609 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782278609 +0000\n\ntest: run app-server integration tests under Wine (#29788)\n\n## Why\n\nMade a mistake when carving #29746 out of my local changes and the test\nwas missing from the build graph. Oops!\n\n## What\n\nEnable the app-server Wine exec test target. Remove the `manual` tag\nfrom generated Wine-exec test variants so wildcard Bazel test\ninvocations select them. Refactor the smoke test to ensure it passes\nwith current Windows support.","verified_at":"2026-06-24T05:23:30Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/b17f30eb2a670ad49c5cccfd7e29553ac62cf108/comments","author":{"login":"anp-oai","id":286154589,"node_id":"U_kgDOEQ5fXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286154589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/anp-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8"}]},{"sha":"e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGU2MzllOGM0YmQ5YjZhNjVjYzUxNzBmZTNlMjM2NTU4NjM3ZDU1Zjg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Adam Perry @ OpenAI","email":"anp@openai.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:08:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T05:08:23Z"},"message":"connectors: own app metadata types (#29723)\n\n## Why\n\nConnector metadata is consumed by connector discovery, ChatGPT\nintegration, core, and TUI code. Treating app-server's wire DTO as the\nshared domain model reverses the intended dependency direction.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added connector-owned app branding, review, screenshot, metadata, and\ninfo types.\n- Added explicit conversions in app-server and TUI while preserving\napp-server's wire payloads.\n- Removed production app-server-protocol dependencies from connectors\nand ChatGPT connector code.\n\n## Stack\n\nThis is PR 4 of 6, stacked on [PR\n#29722](https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/29722). Review only the\ndelta from `codex/split-config-layer-types`. Next: [PR\n#29724](https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/29724).\n\n## Validation\n\n- Connector and tools coverage passed.\n- App-server app-list coverage passed: 13 tests.","tree":{"sha":"3759f110361ebf59f09bde07dc9e061e6b9658a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/3759f110361ebf59f09bde07dc9e061e6b9658a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqO2ZHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL9AQAHOqeAsu5e204x9v9JhRFo7b\nyPbUAPfinR/SVu+6H+qrz7EOWH0XGMQv5TwRomx7X3BezZVYJNRFvG6RH2bf1Pko\nz2wJCF2cSYDoSKnxBM6myi/WmsXNkD/lGmVWMxBqhvZvwx4AEn++Amcx/GsCHPuf\nK1x1ttqfQk1MTJGthJk/l0Sm92zQfcZydUvTkibrUrfaRdFodFGMSw7KmeQqgzco\nyvc9fDARVZ7R+jJFVBObBK5C336zct5v1fli8vM/0gYDLLq3klgurMnadpC4W+Vk\nmGr3OHGtBNPzHtaGR7sUXhryADKOKf5W4iD91DJmRKXpXkLC1aypYAaiIRK5v67d\nWmJEhO3/UuFNyJzSJlRwgKVeRSUxuxLa8vh4Hl2HqcYji0e84wBbB5/u5RDQkvub\nl+V09fncQMRb1kf62EbC8SdjAA5KL96ggEwKGionYAMBDu/w/0WaBY8b8N6IjuQl\nV/ABiwkrVJtVqoVzjWN/txkKRjAoev1fWzMc94jQURUgzzGPOdbChE1dWXigfMpz\nFX3FxhO/HFKVs+sShY8cFOBe3aafr25AqfCQ82Q8CNniEmvTbmhKdTIBTcUL6Vhk\nu3rH+xPf31uuStzeqpRmPjD+F/O1zu9owJOUCZfDQzScgIkMzjwjjfPb577reFLc\n5eZ+qsuJxmburilO1aQh\n=Qj3L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3759f110361ebf59f09bde07dc9e061e6b9658a6\nparent 1d65ccabd59795b0342bd4a60bd1944f5cc4763e\nauthor Adam Perry @ OpenAI <anp@openai.com> 1782277703 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782277703 -0700\n\nconnectors: own app metadata types (#29723)\n\n## Why\n\nConnector metadata is consumed by connector discovery, ChatGPT\nintegration, core, and TUI code. Treating app-server's wire DTO as the\nshared domain model reverses the intended dependency direction.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added connector-owned app branding, review, screenshot, metadata, and\ninfo types.\n- Added explicit conversions in app-server and TUI while preserving\napp-server's wire payloads.\n- Removed production app-server-protocol dependencies from connectors\nand ChatGPT connector code.\n\n## Stack\n\nThis is PR 4 of 6, stacked on [PR\n#29722](https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/29722). Review only the\ndelta from `codex/split-config-layer-types`. Next: [PR\n#29724](https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/29724).\n\n## Validation\n\n- Connector and tools coverage passed.\n- App-server app-list coverage passed: 13 tests.","verified_at":"2026-06-24T05:08:23Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e639e8c4bd9b6a65cc5170fe3e236558637d55f8/comments","author":{"login":"anp-oai","id":286154589,"node_id":"U_kgDOEQ5fXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286154589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/anp-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anp-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u