ption\nhas been deprecated since #11631.\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tests pass","verified_at":"2026-06-23T19:13:54Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/2cf2a6a844f1fc2ddd489c8a67fa8bc2f59a6f3d","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/2cf2a6a844f1fc2ddd489c8a67fa8bc2f59a6f3d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/2cf2a6a844f1fc2ddd489c8a67fa8bc2f59a6f3d/comments","author":{"login":"dylan-hurd-oai","id":220976066,"node_id":"U_kgDODSvTwg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220976066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/dylan-hurd-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylan-hurd-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79"}]},{"sha":"e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKGU0NzZmYzE2Y2U4MTA0OTVjYmZhYmU0ZjgxNWQyMDk0N2RhMGJhNzk","commit":{"author":{"name":"jif","email":"jif@openai.com","date":"2026-06-23T19:07:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T19:07:09Z"},"message":"Prepare managed network sandbox context (#29456)\n\n## Why\n\nManaged network configures commands to use local HTTP and SOCKS proxies.\nFor commands delegated to the exec server, the proxy environment and the\nsandbox policy were prepared separately. On macOS, that meant a command\ncould receive `HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:43123` while Seatbelt still\ndenied access to port `43123`.\n\n## What changed\n\n`NetworkProxy` now prepares the command environment and sandbox context\ntogether from the same runtime snapshot:\n\n```text\nPrepared managed network\n├── command environment: HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:43123\n└── sandbox context: allow outbound to 127.0.0.1:43123\n```\n\nThat context travels with remote exec requests. The exec server\npreserves the managed proxy and CA environment, and macOS Seatbelt\nallows only the prepared loopback proxy ports without enabling broad\nnetwork access or local binding.\n\nThe protocol field is optional and the existing enforcement flag remains\nin place, preserving compatibility with callers that do not send the new\ncontext.","tree":{"sha":"36a75792c5b4a2f99d1673870e12f2b016ebfffb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/36a75792c5b4a2f99d1673870e12f2b016ebfffb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOtldCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9HYQAKjMa5nNYkSyOsl06BCTR5QO\nmZVfs186SNcf9qim5ziWkrR5aqYIZ/uAGDwbyBXi7lc85nWcKo2iFy47N+nBpJos\njFSd3uxNyIDsu6sznMBR0ErBtCscM3uAXpCFUgGO3If3qCV4PbwC8h3acBhw55Od\nCsbLBqXniAzGUrCYQWeTKO4TfwnyUSDqtaw5O+KPWnt2n5EEVhQggOK6VbtILPOg\nczIv+X85VPTSlpf99Zg4dBzom7XyahMrWhHelxfLTtI1pstT6GvIH+jL98rq5gwX\nTYMW3BbeM2mS0dI4n227BuX9KEkNuy6MDW4JBqovYG+XJdV6nj0QXkybp6UXm7SV\n32R6PF4EpZRx4dC4/Y6/nxezX11gxmhzDG6zYzdE7edTIme/3EB+/jaBFiVs9iDa\nNNr432LO+Wr/zqGSvwLwpaBpD9To+vD61nl3PG/y7xFbg1pwO0+I6ZVjPZptlqP3\nwGh/6rhvXt/C+682Rqts2BXJ2D5p8TM7yozea+wlSpRrtLvlsfrajzcvgOnY7I6w\n1DSioho0jwvoKjJO20iszTC/gXrA4p41HKRY2yX3Xxq1lw9uA58qlipxbFl9yZi3\nPtBF/pAkwKa/P5IAU96Q7KxiS+iv+E7F/ToGPHciOJD1vlhVnIc5UmVvcEpX70NS\nzlmZk7WOoTC6674JlTo+\n=Nhw7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 36a75792c5b4a2f99d1673870e12f2b016ebfffb\nparent 8d80b0176a3564e4061f3b29d8883f73d51e96d4\nauthor jif <jif@openai.com> 1782241629 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782241629 +0100\n\nPrepare managed network sandbox context (#29456)\n\n## Why\n\nManaged network configures commands to use local HTTP and SOCKS proxies.\nFor commands delegated to the exec server, the proxy environment and the\nsandbox policy were prepared separately. On macOS, that meant a command\ncould receive `HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:43123` while Seatbelt still\ndenied access to port `43123`.\n\n## What changed\n\n`NetworkProxy` now prepares the command environment and sandbox context\ntogether from the same runtime snapshot:\n\n```text\nPrepared managed network\n├── command environment: HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:43123\n└── sandbox context: allow outbound to 127.0.0.1:43123\n```\n\nThat context travels with remote exec requests. The exec server\npreserves the managed proxy and CA environment, and macOS Seatbelt\nallows only the prepared loopback proxy ports without enabling broad\nnetwork access or local binding.\n\nThe protocol field is optional and the existing enforcement flag remains\nin place, preserving compatibility with callers that do not send the new\ncontext.","verified_at":"2026-06-23T19:07:10Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/e476fc16ce810495cbfabe4f815d20947da0ba79/comments","author":{"login":"jif-oai","id":230027070,"node_id":"U_kgDODbXvPg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230027070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/jif-oai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jif-oai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.